    description: "Mechanical sweep: add @override (typing.override on 3.12+, typing_extensions.override on 3.10/3.11) to every method that overrides a base-class method. Then enable the explicit-override error code in [tool.mypy] (already proposed in W4's error-code list; this is the sweep that lets the gate close). Catches drift when a base-class method signature changes but a subclass doesn't update. Useful for the analyzer-base-class family and any linker subclasses that override base behavior."  # 1db5
